00:02:02.907 --> 00:02:06.574
I don't know if we can be friends anymore.

00:02:07.945 --> 00:02:09.467
No new friends.

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.580
I started from the
bottom and now I'm here.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.019
- You know what, I'm just
going to get my own drink.

00:02:13.019 --> 00:02:15.177
- Well just hold on! Just hold on.

00:02:16.363 --> 00:02:17.779
